# SteamUnlocked

> SteamUnlocked is a PC game website with a browsable catalog, game information, links to externally hosted downloads, and a Windows desktop launcher. The official website is https://steamunlocked.org/.

This file is maintained by SteamUnlocked. Last reviewed: September 15, 2026.

Domain information:
- https://steamunlocked.org/ is the current canonical home of SteamUnlocked.
- SteamUnlocked previously used steamunlocked.net. The move to .org is documented in the FAQ linked below.
- The HTTPS homepages at steamunlocked.net and steamunlocked.com redirect to https://steamunlocked.org/ with HTTP 301 permanent redirects. These are redirecting entry points to the .org website.

Game pages provide descriptions, version information, screenshots, system requirements, and download links. Linked game downloads are hosted on UploadHaven, an external service with its own terms and privacy practices. Game names, artwork, and other third-party materials belong to their respective owners; their appearance does not imply endorsement or affiliation.

Our team scans each game for malware and tests installation and launch before publication, checking that it starts successfully in our test environment.

Game availability, versions, and launcher releases change over time. The linked game pages and launcher page carry current details. The website's browser-saved My Library and the desktop launcher's library are separate features.

