## Browse games

- [All Games (A-Z)](https://steamunlocked.org/all-games/): Alphabetical catalog and links to individual game pages.
- [Categories](https://steamunlocked.org/categories/): Browse the catalog by genre and other categories.
- [Collections](https://steamunlocked.org/collections/): Curated groups organized by franchise, theme, and play style.
- [Recently Updated](https://steamunlocked.org/recently-updated/): Game updates grouped by date, with listed version details.
- [Most Popular](https://steamunlocked.org/most-downloaded/): Games ranked by overall recorded game-page views. The URL retains the older "most-downloaded" name; these are page-view rankings, not download totals.
- [Trending](https://steamunlocked.org/trending/): Games ranked by recent game-page views; the page explains its reporting period.

## Desktop launcher and news

- [SteamUnlocked Launcher](https://steamunlocked.org/steamunlocked-launcher/): Windows desktop app for browsing, downloading, extracting, organizing, and launching games. Includes the current download, system requirements, and release information.
- [News and Updates](https://steamunlocked.org/latest-news/): Launcher release notes and website announcements.

## Optional

- [Request Games](https://steamunlocked.org/request-games/): Guidelines and comments for suggesting games to add.
- [Request Updates](https://steamunlocked.org/request-updates/): Guidelines and comments for suggesting updates to existing listings.
- [My Library](https://steamunlocked.org/my-library/): Games saved in the visitor's browser. A fresh browser or crawler sees an empty library, not a public catalog or another visitor's saved games.
- [Privacy Policy](https://steamunlocked.org/privacy-policy/): Google Analytics, Cloudflare, Disqus, cookies, and browser storage used for saved games.
- [Terms of Service](https://steamunlocked.org/terms-of-service/): Website rules, comments, external services, and responsibilities.
- [XML sitemap index](https://steamunlocked.org/su-sitemap.xml): Sitemap files listing public website URLs.
- [robots.txt](https://steamunlocked.org/robots.txt): Website crawling directives.
